Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:07.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:18.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:23.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:27.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:34.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:41.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:49.25,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:55.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:59.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:03.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:10.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:21.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好担心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还以为戈薇再也不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不好好的跟戈薇道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两人是怎么搞定的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 八成是 戈薇姑娘愿意妥协吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,允许犬夜叉和桔梗劈腿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不可置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇居然能忍受这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉太会钻牛角尖了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在穷追猛打我想不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他从平常就没从容过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他也有点不安吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第49话 琥珀失去的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是奈落的城的遗迹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还残留着些许奈落的瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连点痕迹都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是真的有座城才是怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得也是 现在回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:14.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前也是把我们 诱骗到假的城里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时看到的城是幻觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落之城的确曾经在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.43,0:03:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 找到什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家父的铠甲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候 我们这些驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被诱骗到奈落城里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我也来…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是 家父与同伴惨遭杀害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手的人 是我的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子受奈落所操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸首就埋在庭院的一角
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能让令尊与大家的遗骨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弃置在这种不祥之地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想把他们 带到适当的地点好好供奉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果说这里就是奈落的城
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城中的那些人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:32.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚那 受奈落所控制的弟弟琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会也跟着城堡一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不会被野狗挖出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时就请各位安眠于此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会在我们的村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的为各位造墓的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然村子里已经没有人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:06:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还有我与琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两人可以守着坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子 手艺真不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的看得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还让你帮忙砍柴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.49,0:06:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你也累了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到屋里喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 有想起什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是自己从哪来之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最起码该知道自己的名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在这个城附近的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概十天前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人见大人的城仿佛失踪般
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失的无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天就发现你倒在旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是经历什么很可怕的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:33.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会什么都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没关系 别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对对 在你想起来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢怎样都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 还有这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量多吃点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:08:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我似乎曾在那里待过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老公公 老婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以千万不要出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们这段时间的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是从城里逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天 城消失的晚上…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经没有活下去的必要了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到你父亲跟同伴的身边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫…琥珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很近了 就在森林那一带
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.34,0:09:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的目的也是四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你逃不掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 把埋在你体内的 四魂之玉碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:55.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那妖怪想夺走 琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀的性命全靠 埋在体内的四魂碎片维系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片一旦被取出…他就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被奈落控制了心智…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在奈落的城里才对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手腕受伤了 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:11:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我以前见过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从城里逃走前的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:07.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落也不记得？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经没有活下去的必要了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到你父亲跟同伴的身边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:26.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说 那就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子一定是在演戏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过看起来不像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是 以前出现在 我们面前的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛被抽走魂魄的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.19,0:11:46.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们两人独处不要紧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为珊瑚说想和他独处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师的村落？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们以前住在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我也能驱逐妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见习的程度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微休息一下 待会还得工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也准备一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经十一岁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也差不多该参与实战了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪真的会吐出火或毒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们驱除的 通常只是大蛇或大蜘蛛之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最可怕的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那些伪装成人形的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是被那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到四魂之玉的话就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是 被奈落叫去的那天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好是琥珀第一次上阵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.14,0:13:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就你所知的 请全部告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛昔日的琥珀般…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖巧而有点胆小
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点点慢慢的回想就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为今后我们会一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得不太好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是姐弟呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从奈落的手里逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扁他两三拳不就现出原形了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有这么简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这是不是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昔日最疼爱的弟弟已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是陷阱的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚会大受打击的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为奈落 最喜欢玩弄人的感情了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不说的话 我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等不要这样子 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是…关于琥珀的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的陷阱不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是想要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我除了相信还能怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的技俩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若不是我们及时赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片被抽出来话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟就会真的死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:24.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 这就是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好像因为 自己在这里的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而害那个温柔的人遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能留在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是太疼弟弟才分不清道理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆 你懂什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.43,0:15:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好给我认清现实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且本来就是犬夜叉你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且是一大群
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们难道是针对琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的气息移动了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:32.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须要保护琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们将琥珀藏起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想装蒜 他是奈落养的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀那家伙竟然趁乱逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片还在他身上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是来带他回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也真是小题大作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过想要四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就带这么庞大的阵仗来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说目标是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过没了那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体就丢给他姐姐珊瑚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.37,0:17:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么追来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的目标是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不要再离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要对我这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:56.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一的亲弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 琥珀交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:13.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去阻止它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:23.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你一定要活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有箭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.01,0:20:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲到那个洞里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在犬夜叉他们来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就先待在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.43,0:20:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 珊瑚很强的 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你还没想起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚是你姐姐的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得好怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:56.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚被迫和你分开后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:59.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段时间一直很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然她平常很坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有时也会露出落寞的神情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以琥珀回来真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以和她在一起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:18.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话 你就能想起她的一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能想起那个人的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.02,0:21:38.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么可怕的东西 我非想起来不可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉好慢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔之矢用光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.85,0:22:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:30.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:42.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:49.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:57.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.11,0:23:04.64,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:12.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.19,0:23:19.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:27.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:34.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记忆被消除的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.33,0:23:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍然受奈落的操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实行奈落命令杀害戈薇的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚知道这件事情之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:24:00.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定杀了琥珀然后再自尽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现是陷阱而拼命的 消灭毒虫与妖怪的弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.01,0:24:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.28,0:24:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点去阻止珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.82,0:24:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张脸绝不会自心底消失
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:14.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
